    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abafirisiti nibanga kwesiga Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafirisiti amahe gaabu goona bakagasorooleza Afeki, kandi Abaisirairi baateera orukande haihi n'iziba erikaba liri Yezereeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalemi ba Abafirisiti obubakaba nibagenda omumaiso beebaganiizeemu ebikumi n'enkumi, Daudi n'abasaija be, nabo bakaba nibabakurata, bali hamu n'omukama Akisi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "engabwa z'Abafirisiti obu zaababoine, zaayekaguza ziti: “Abahebburaayo banu nibakora ki hanu?” Akisi yagarukamu ati: “Onu nuwe Daudi omuheereza wa Saulo omukama wa Isirairi, ou nyikaire na uwe omwanya mukooto, okuruga ha kiro ekiyanyehongeriireho okuhika na hati, tinyina kintu na kimu ekindukumujunaana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu engabwa z'Abafirisiti zaabihirirwa muno Akisi, nukwo kumuragira ziti: “Omuntu ogu mugarreyo, agaruke mukiikaro ekiwamwolekere, titurukwija kugenda na uwe ha bulemu, ataliikara kutwehindurra akaturwanisa. Magezi ki omuntu ogu agaasobora kucwa kugarukanganamu na mukama we, okukira kwita abantu baitu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.18.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 18:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.21.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu, tali nuwe Daudi, abakazi ou baazinaga nibaanuukurana bati: ‘Saulo akaita enkumi, baitu Daudi aisire emitwaro’?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akisi nukwo kweta Daudi yamugambira ati: “Ndahiire Ruhanga omwomeezi owa Isirairi obaire oli mwesigwa hali nyowe; habweki kyakunsemiize kugenda na iwe kurwana obulemu bunu. Habwokuba okuruga ha kiro ekiwampikiireho okuhika ha kiro kya hati, tinkakuzoiremu nsobi neemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu abalemi abandi nubo bakwangire. Orame ogende n'obusinge, oleke kubabiihiza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yakaguza Akisi ati: “Baitu nkakora ki? Nkooku ogambire, okuruga ha kiro eki natandikiireho kukuheereza okuhika na hati, toina na kimu ekyorukunjunaana, ekirukuntanga kugenda niwe mukama wange omukama, nkarwanisa abanyanzigwa bawe, nikyo nka kiha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akisi yagarukamu Daudi ati: “Hali nyowe, nooyera tititi nka malaika wa Ruhanga; engabwa z'Abafirisiti, nubo bagambire ngu: ‘Titurukwija kugenda na uwe ha bulemu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leero nu, nyenkya ozinduke kara, hamu n'abaheereza ba mukama wawe aba waizire nabo, mwimukye kara, bagaruke omunsi y'Abafirisiti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Abafirisiti, bakagenda Yezereeri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
